{"v":[{"a":["نٓۚ","وَٱلۡقَلَمِ","وَمَا","يَسۡطُرُونَ"],"t":"Noon. By the pen, and by what they inscribe","l":"Nun Wa Al-Qalami Wa Ma Yasturuna","w":[["noon","Nun"],["wal-qalami","By the pen"],["wamā","and what"],["yasṭurūna","they write"]]},{"a":["مَآ","أَنتَ","بِنِعۡمَةِ","رَبِّكَ","بِمَجۡنُونٖ"],"t":"By the grace of your Lord, you are not insane","l":"Ma 'Anta Bini`mati Rabbika Bimajnunin","w":[["mā","Not"],["anta","you (are)"],["biniʿ'mati","by (the) Grace"],["rabbika","(of) your Lord"],["bimajnūnin","a madman"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّ","لَكَ","لَأَجۡرًا","غَيۡرَ","مَمۡنُونٖ"],"t":"In fact, you will have a reward that will never end","l":"Wa 'Inna Laka La'ajraan Ghayra Mamnunin","w":[["wa-inna","And indeed"],["laka","for you"],["la-ajran","surely (is) a reward"],["ghayra","without"],["mamnūnin","end"]]},{"a":["وَإِنَّكَ","لَعَلَىٰ","خُلُقٍ","عَظِيمٖ"],"t":"And you are of a great moral character","l":"Wa 'Innaka La`ala Khuluqin `Azimin","w":[["wa-innaka","And indeed, you"],["laʿalā","surely (are)"],["khuluqin","(of) a moral character"],["ʿaẓīmin","great"]]},{"a":["فَسَتُبۡصِرُ","وَيُبۡصِرُونَ"],"t":"You will see, and they will see","l":"Fasatubsiru Wa Yubsiruna","w":[["fasatub'ṣiru","So you will see"],["wayub'ṣirūna","and they will see"]]},{"a":["بِأَييِّكُمُ","ٱلۡمَفۡتُونُ"],"t":"Which of you is the afflicted","l":"Bi'ayyyikumu Al-Maftunu","w":[["bi-ayyikumu","Which of you"],["l-maftūnu","(is) the afflicted one"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","هُوَ","أَعۡلَمُ","بِمَن","ضَلَّ","عَن","سَبِيلِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","أَعۡلَمُ","بِٱلۡمُهۡتَدِينَ"],"t":"Your Lord knows best who has strayed from His path, and He knows best the well-guided","l":"Inna Rabbaka Huwa 'A`lamu Biman Đalla `An Sabilihi Wa Huwa 'A`lamu Bil-Muhtadina","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["rabbaka","your Lord"],["huwa","He"],["aʿlamu","(is) most knowing"],["biman","of (he) who"],["ḍalla","has strayed"],["ʿan","from"],["sabīlihi","His way"],["wahuwa","and He"],["aʿlamu","(is) most knowing"],["bil-muh'tadīna","of the guided ones"]]},{"a":["فَلَا","تُطِعِ","ٱلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ"],"t":"So do not obey the deniers","l":"Fala Tuti`i Al-Mukadhibina","w":[["falā","So (do) not"],["tuṭiʿi","obey"],["l-mukadhibīna","the deniers"]]},{"a":["وَدُّواْ","لَوۡ","تُدۡهِنُ","فَيُدۡهِنُونَ"],"t":"They would like you to compromise, so they would compromise","l":"Wa Ddu Law Tud/hinu Fayud/hinuna","w":[["waddū","They wish"],["law","that"],["tud'hinu","you should compromise"],["fayud'hinūna","so they would compromise"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","تُطِعۡ","كُلَّ","حَلَّافٖ","مَّهِينٍ"],"t":"And do not obey any vile swearer","l":"Wa La Tuti` Kulla Hallafin Mahinin","w":[["walā","And (do) not"],["tuṭiʿ","obey"],["kulla","every"],["ḥallāfin","habitual swearer"],["mahīnin","worthless"]]},{"a":["هَمَّازٖ","مَّشَّآءِۭ","بِنَمِيمٖ"],"t":"Backbiter, spreader of slander","l":"Hammazin Masha'in Binamimin","w":[["hammāzin","Defamer"],["mashāin","going about"],["binamīmin","with malicious gossip"]]},{"a":["مَّنَّاعٖ","لِّلۡخَيۡرِ","مُعۡتَدٍ","أَثِيمٍ"],"t":"Preventer of good, transgressor, sinner","l":"Manna`in Lilkhayri Mu`tadin 'Athimin","w":[["mannāʿin","A preventer"],["lil'khayri","of (the) good"],["muʿ'tadin","transgressor"],["athīmin","sinful"]]},{"a":["عُتُلِّۭ","بَعۡدَ","ذَٰلِكَ","زَنِيمٍ"],"t":"Rude and fake besides","l":"Utullin Ba`da Dhalika Zanimin","w":[["ʿutullin","Cruel"],["baʿda","after"],["dhālika","(all) that"],["zanīmin","utterly useless"]]},{"a":["أَن","كَانَ","ذَا","مَالٖ","وَبَنِينَ"],"t":"Just because he has money and children","l":"An Kana Dha Malin Wa Banina","w":[["an","Because"],["kāna","(he) is"],["dhā","a possessor"],["mālin","(of) wealth"],["wabanīna","and children"]]},{"a":["إِذَا","تُتۡلَىٰ","عَلَيۡهِ","ءَايَٰتُنَا","قَالَ","أَسَٰطِيرُ","ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ"],"t":"When Our Verses are recited to him, he says, “Myths of the ancients!”","l":"Idha Tutla `Alayhi 'Ayatuna Qala 'Asatiru Al-'Awwalina","w":[["idhā","When"],["tut'lā","are recited"],["ʿalayhi","to him"],["āyātunā","Our Verses"],["qāla","he says"],["asāṭīru","Stories"],["l-awalīna","(of) the former (people)"]]},{"a":["سَنَسِمُهُۥ","عَلَى","ٱلۡخُرۡطُومِ"],"t":"We will brand him on the muzzle","l":"Sanasimuhu `Ala Al-Khurtumi","w":[["sanasimuhu","We will brand him"],["ʿalā","on"],["l-khur'ṭūmi","the snout"]]},{"a":["إِنَّا","بَلَوۡنَٰهُمۡ","كَمَا","بَلَوۡنَآ","أَصۡحَٰبَ","ٱلۡجَنَّةِ","إِذۡ","أَقۡسَمُواْ","لَيَصۡرِمُنَّهَا","مُصۡبِحِينَ"],"t":"We tested them, as We tested the owners of the garden, when they vowed to harvest it in the morning","l":"Inna Balawnahum Kama Balawna 'Ashaba Al-Jannati 'Idh 'Aqsamu Layasrimunnaha Musbihina","w":[["innā","Indeed, We"],["balawnāhum","have tried them"],["kamā","as"],["balawnā","We tried"],["aṣḥāba","(the) companions"],["l-janati","(of) the garden"],["idh","when"],["aqsamū","they swore"],["layaṣrimunnahā","to pluck its fruit"],["muṣ'biḥīna","(in the) morning"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","يَسۡتَثۡنُونَ"],"t":"Without any reservation","l":"Wa La Yastathnuna","w":[["walā","And not"],["yastathnūna","making exception"]]},{"a":["فَطَافَ","عَلَيۡهَا","طَآئِفٞ","مِّن","رَّبِّكَ","وَهُمۡ","نَآئِمُونَ"],"t":"But a calamity from your Lord went around it while they slept","l":"Fatafa `Alayha Ta'ifun Min Rabbika Wa Hum Na'imuna","w":[["faṭāfa","So there came"],["ʿalayhā","upon it"],["ṭāifun","a visitation"],["min","from"],["rabbika","your Lord"],["wahum","while they"],["nāimūna","were asleep"]]},{"a":["فَأَصۡبَحَتۡ","كَٱلصَّرِيمِ"],"t":"And in the morning it was as if picked","l":"Fa'asbahat Kalssarimi","w":[["fa-aṣbaḥat","So it became"],["kal-ṣarīmi","as if reaped"]]},{"a":["فَتَنَادَوۡاْ","مُصۡبِحِينَ"],"t":"In the morning, they called to one another","l":"Fatanadaw Musbihina","w":[["fatanādaw","And they called one another"],["muṣ'biḥīna","(at) morning"]]},{"a":["أَنِ","ٱغۡدُواْ","عَلَىٰ","حَرۡثِكُمۡ","إِن","كُنتُمۡ","صَٰرِمِينَ"],"t":"“Go early to your plantation, if you are going to harvest.”","l":"Ani Aghdu `Ala Harthikum 'In Kuntum Sarimina","w":[["ani","That"],["igh'dū","Go early"],["ʿalā","to"],["ḥarthikum","your crop"],["in","if"],["kuntum","you would"],["ṣārimīna","pluck (the) fruit"]]},{"a":["فَٱنطَلَقُواْ","وَهُمۡ","يَتَخَٰفَتُونَ"],"t":"So off they went, murmuring to one another","l":"Fantalaqu Wa Hum Yatakhafatuna","w":[["fa-inṭalaqū","So they went"],["wahum","while they"],["yatakhāfatūna","lowered (their) voices"]]},{"a":["أَن","لَّا","يَدۡخُلَنَّهَا","ٱلۡيَوۡمَ","عَلَيۡكُم","مِّسۡكِينٞ"],"t":"“No poor person is to enter it upon you today.”","l":"An La Yadkhulannaha Al-Yawma `Alaykum Miskinun","w":[["an","That"],["lā","Not"],["yadkhulannahā","will enter it"],["l-yawma","today"],["ʿalaykum","upon you"],["mis'kīnun","any poor person"]]},{"a":["وَغَدَوۡاْ","عَلَىٰ","حَرۡدٖ","قَٰدِرِينَ"],"t":"And early they went, resolved in intent","l":"Waghadaw `Ala Hardin Qadirina","w":[["waghadaw","And they went early"],["ʿalā","with"],["ḥardin","determination"],["qādirīna","able"]]},{"a":["فَلَمَّا","رَأَوۡهَا","قَالُوٓاْ","إِنَّا","لَضَآلُّونَ"],"t":"But when they saw it, they said, “We were wrong","l":"Falamma Ra'awha Qalu 'Inna Lađalluna","w":[["falammā","But when"],["ra-awhā","they saw it"],["qālū","they said"],["innā","Indeed, we"],["laḍāllūna","(are) surely lost"]]},{"a":["بَلۡ","نَحۡنُ","مَحۡرُومُونَ"],"t":"We are now deprived.”","l":"Bal Nahnu Mahrumuna","w":[["bal","Nay"],["naḥnu","We"],["maḥrūmūna","(are) deprived"]]},{"a":["قَالَ","أَوۡسَطُهُمۡ","أَلَمۡ","أَقُل","لَّكُمۡ","لَوۡلَا","تُسَبِّحُونَ"],"t":"The most reasonable of them said, “Did I not say to you, ‘if only you would glorify?’”","l":"Qala 'Awsatuhum 'Alam 'Aqul Lakum Lawla Tusabbihuna","w":[["qāla","Said"],["awsaṭuhum","(the) most moderate of them"],["alam","Did not"],["aqul","I tell"],["lakum","you"],["lawlā","'Why not"],["tusabbiḥūna","you glorify (Allah)?'"]]},{"a":["قَالُواْ","سُبۡحَٰنَ","رَبِّنَآ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","ظَٰلِمِينَ"],"t":"They said, “Glory to our Lord—We were indeed in the wrong.”","l":"Qalu Subhana Rabbina 'Inna Kunna Zalimina","w":[["qālū","They said"],["sub'ḥāna","Glory be"],["rabbinā","(to) our Lord"],["innā","Indeed, we"],["kunnā","[we] were"],["ẓālimīna","wrongdoers"]]},{"a":["فَأَقۡبَلَ","بَعۡضُهُمۡ","عَلَىٰ","بَعۡضٖ","يَتَلَٰوَمُونَ"],"t":"Then they turned to one another, blaming one another","l":"Fa'aqbala Ba`đuhum `Ala Ba`đin Yatalawamuna","w":[["fa-aqbala","Then approached"],["baʿḍuhum","some of them"],["ʿalā","to"],["baʿḍin","others"],["yatalāwamūna","blaming each other"]]},{"a":["قَالُواْ","يَٰوَيۡلَنَآ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","طَٰغِينَ"],"t":"They said, “Woe to us—we were indeed domineering","l":"Qalu Ya Waylana 'Inna Kunna Taghina","w":[["qālū","They said"],["yāwaylanā","O woe to us"],["innā","Indeed, we"],["kunnā","[we] were"],["ṭāghīna","transgressors"]]},{"a":["عَسَىٰ","رَبُّنَآ","أَن","يُبۡدِلَنَا","خَيۡرٗا","مِّنۡهَآ","إِنَّآ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّنَا","رَٰغِبُونَ"],"t":"Perhaps our Lord will give us a better substitute for it. We are turning to our Lord.”","l":"Asa Rabbuna 'An Yubdilana Khayraan Minha 'Inna 'Ila Rabbina Raghibuna","w":[["ʿasā","Perhaps"],["rabbunā","our Lord"],["an","[that]"],["yub'dilanā","will substitute for us"],["khayran","a better"],["min'hā","than it"],["innā","Indeed, we"],["ilā","to"],["rabbinā","our Lord"],["rāghibūna","turn devoutly"]]},{"a":["كَذَٰلِكَ","ٱلۡعَذَابُۖ","وَلَعَذَابُ","ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","أَكۡبَرُۚ","لَوۡ","كَانُواْ","يَعۡلَمُونَ"],"t":"Such is the punishment; but the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew","l":"Kadhalika Al-`Adhabu Wa La`adhabu Al-'Akhirati 'Akbaru Law Kanu Ya`lamuna","w":[["kadhālika","Such"],["l-ʿadhābu","(is) the punishment"],["walaʿadhābu","And surely the punishment"],["l-ākhirati","(of) the Hereafter"],["akbaru","(is) greater"],["law","if"],["kānū","they"],["yaʿlamūna","know"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","لِلۡمُتَّقِينَ","عِندَ","رَبِّهِمۡ","جَنَّـٰتِ","ٱلنَّعِيمِ"],"t":"For the righteous are Gardens of Delight with their Lord","l":"Inna Lilmuttaqina `Inda Rabbihim Jannati An-Na`imi","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["lil'muttaqīna","for the righteous"],["ʿinda","with"],["rabbihim","their Lord"],["jannāti","(are) Gardens"],["l-naʿīmi","(of) Delight"]]},{"a":["أَفَنَجۡعَلُ","ٱلۡمُسۡلِمِينَ","كَٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ"],"t":"Shall We treat the Muslims like the villains","l":"Afanaj`alu Al-Muslimina Kalmujrimina","w":[["afanajʿalu","Then will We treat"],["l-mus'limīna","the Muslims"],["kal-muj'rimīna","like the criminals"]]},{"a":["مَا","لَكُمۡ","كَيۡفَ","تَحۡكُمُونَ"],"t":"What is the matter with you? How do you judge","l":"Ma Lakum Kayfa Tahkumuna","w":[["mā","What"],["lakum","(is) for you"],["kayfa","How"],["taḥkumūna","(do) you judge"]]},{"a":["أَمۡ","لَكُمۡ","كِتَٰبٞ","فِيهِ","تَدۡرُسُونَ"],"t":"Or do you have a scripture in which you study","l":"Am Lakum Kitabun Fihi Tadrusuna","w":[["am","Or"],["lakum","(is) for you"],["kitābun","a book"],["fīhi","wherein"],["tadrusūna","you learn"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","لَكُمۡ","فِيهِ","لَمَا","تَخَيَّرُونَ"],"t":"Wherein there is whatever you choose","l":"Inna Lakum Fihi Lama Takhayyaruna","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["lakum","for you"],["fīhi","in it"],["lamā","what"],["takhayyarūna","you choose"]]},{"a":["أَمۡ","لَكُمۡ","أَيۡمَٰنٌ","عَلَيۡنَا","بَٰلِغَةٌ","إِلَىٰ","يَوۡمِ","ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ","إِنَّ","لَكُمۡ","لَمَا","تَحۡكُمُونَ"],"t":"Or do you have oaths from Us, binding until the Day of Resurrection, that you will have whatever you demand","l":"Am Lakum 'Aymanun `Alayna Balighatun 'Ila Yawmi Al-Qiyamati 'Inna Lakum Lama Tahkumuna","w":[["am","Or"],["lakum","for you"],["aymānun","oaths"],["ʿalaynā","from us"],["bālighatun","reaching"],["ilā","to"],["yawmi","(the) Day"],["l-qiyāmati","(of) the Resurrection"],["inna","indeed"],["lakum","for you"],["lamā","(is) what"],["taḥkumūna","you judge"]]},{"a":["سَلۡهُمۡ","أَيُّهُم","بِذَٰلِكَ","زَعِيمٌ"],"t":"Ask them, which of them will guarantee that","l":"Salhum 'Ayyuhum Bidhalika Za`imun","w":[["salhum","Ask them"],["ayyuhum","which of them"],["bidhālika","for that"],["zaʿīmun","(is) responsible"]]},{"a":["أَمۡ","لَهُمۡ","شُرَكَآءُ","فَلۡيَأۡتُواْ","بِشُرَكَآئِهِمۡ","إِن","كَانُواْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"t":"Or do they have partners? Then let them produce their partners, if they are truthful","l":"Am Lahum Shuraka'u Falya'tu Bishuraka'ihim 'In Kanu Sadiqina","w":[["am","Or"],["lahum","(are) for them"],["shurakāu","partners"],["falyatū","Then let them bring"],["bishurakāihim","their partners"],["in","if"],["kānū","they are"],["ṣādiqīna","truthful"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يُكۡشَفُ","عَن","سَاقٖ","وَيُدۡعَوۡنَ","إِلَى","ٱلسُّجُودِ","فَلَا","يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ"],"t":"On the Day when the Shin will be exposed, and they will be called to bow down, but they will be unable","l":"Yawma Yukshafu `An Saqin Wa Yud`awna 'Ila As-Sujudi Fala Yastati`una","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yuk'shafu","will be uncovered"],["ʿan","from"],["sāqin","the shin"],["wayud'ʿawna","and they will be called"],["ilā","to"],["l-sujūdi","prostrate"],["falā","but not"],["yastaṭīʿūna","they will be able"]]},{"a":["خَٰشِعَةً","أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ","تَرۡهَقُهُمۡ","ذِلَّةٞۖ","وَقَدۡ","كَانُواْ","يُدۡعَوۡنَ","إِلَى","ٱلسُّجُودِ","وَهُمۡ","سَٰلِمُونَ"],"t":"Their eyes subdued, shame will cover them. They were invited to bow down when they were sound","l":"Khashi`atan 'Absaruhum Tarhaquhum Dhillatun Wa Qad Kanu Yud`awna 'Ila As-Sujudi Wa Hum Salimuna","w":[["khāshiʿatan","Humbled"],["abṣāruhum","their eyes"],["tarhaquhum","will cover them"],["dhillatun","humiliation"],["waqad","And indeed"],["kānū","they were"],["yud'ʿawna","called"],["ilā","to"],["l-sujūdi","prostrate"],["wahum","while they"],["sālimūna","(were) sound"]]},{"a":["فَذَرۡنِي","وَمَن","يُكَذِّبُ","بِهَٰذَا","ٱلۡحَدِيثِۖ","سَنَسۡتَدۡرِجُهُم","مِّنۡ","حَيۡثُ","لَا","يَعۡلَمُونَ"],"t":"So leave Me to those who reject this discourse; We will proceed against them gradually, from where they do not know","l":"Fadharni Wa Man Yukadhibu Bihadha Al-Hadithi Sanastadrijuhum Min Haythu La Ya`lamuna","w":[["fadharnī","So leave Me"],["waman","and whoever"],["yukadhibu","denies"],["bihādhā","this"],["l-ḥadīthi","Statement"],["sanastadrijuhum","We will progressively lead them"],["min","from"],["ḥaythu","where"],["lā","not"],["yaʿlamūna","they know"]]},{"a":["وَأُمۡلِي","لَهُمۡۚ","إِنَّ","كَيۡدِي","مَتِينٌ"],"t":"And I will give them respite. My plan is firm","l":"Wa 'Umli Lahum 'Inna Kaydi Matinun","w":[["wa-um'lī","And I will give respite"],["lahum","to them"],["inna","Indeed"],["kaydī","My plan"],["matīnun","(is) firm"]]},{"a":["أَمۡ","تَسۡـَٔلُهُمۡ","أَجۡرٗا","فَهُم","مِّن","مَّغۡرَمٖ","مُّثۡقَلُونَ"],"t":"Or do you ask them for a fee, so they are burdened with debt","l":"Am Tas'aluhum 'Ajraan Fahum Min Maghramin Muthqaluna","w":[["am","Or"],["tasaluhum","you ask them"],["ajran","a payment"],["fahum","so they"],["min","from"],["maghramin","(the) debt"],["muth'qalūna","(are) burdened"]]},{"a":["أَمۡ","عِندَهُمُ","ٱلۡغَيۡبُ","فَهُمۡ","يَكۡتُبُونَ"],"t":"Or do they know the future, and so they write it down","l":"Am `Indahumu Al-Ghaybu Fahum Yaktubuna","w":[["am","Or"],["ʿindahumu","(is) with them"],["l-ghaybu","the unseen"],["fahum","so they"],["yaktubūna","write it"]]},{"a":["فَٱصۡبِرۡ","لِحُكۡمِ","رَبِّكَ","وَلَا","تَكُن","كَصَاحِبِ","ٱلۡحُوتِ","إِذۡ","نَادَىٰ","وَهُوَ","مَكۡظُومٞ"],"t":"So wait patiently for the Decision of your Lord, and do not be like the Fellow of the Fish who cried out in despair","l":"Fasbir Lihukmi Rabbika Wa La Takun Kasahibi Al-Huti 'Idh Nada Wa Huwa Makzumun","w":[["fa-iṣ'bir","So be patient"],["liḥuk'mi","for (the) decision"],["rabbika","(of) your Lord"],["walā","and (do) not"],["takun","be"],["kaṣāḥibi","like (the) companion"],["l-ḥūti","(of) the fish"],["idh","when"],["nādā","he called out"],["wahuwa","while he"],["makẓūmun","(was) distressed"]]},{"a":["لَّوۡلَآ","أَن","تَدَٰرَكَهُۥ","نِعۡمَةٞ","مِّن","رَّبِّهِۦ","لَنُبِذَ","بِٱلۡعَرَآءِ","وَهُوَ","مَذۡمُومٞ"],"t":"Were it not for his Lord’s favor that reached him, he would have been thrown into the wilderness, fully despised","l":"Lawla 'An Tadarakahu Ni`matun Min Rabbihi Lanubidha Bil-`Ara'i Wa Huwa Madhmumun","w":[["lawlā","If not"],["an","that"],["tadārakahu","overtook him"],["niʿ'matun","a Favor"],["min","from"],["rabbihi","his Lord"],["lanubidha","surely he would have been thrown"],["bil-ʿarāi","onto (the) naked shore"],["wahuwa","while he"],["madhmūmun","(was) blamed"]]},{"a":["فَٱجۡتَبَٰهُ","رَبُّهُۥ","فَجَعَلَهُۥ","مِنَ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ"],"t":"But his Lord chose him, and made him one of the righteous","l":"Fajtabahu Rabbuhu Faja`alahu Mina As-Salihina","w":[["fa-ij'tabāhu","But chose him"],["rabbuhu","his Lord"],["fajaʿalahu","and made him"],["mina","of"],["l-ṣāliḥīna","the righteous"]]},{"a":["وَإِن","يَكَادُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُواْ","لَيُزۡلِقُونَكَ","بِأَبۡصَٰرِهِمۡ","لَمَّا","سَمِعُواْ","ٱلذِّكۡرَ","وَيَقُولُونَ","إِنَّهُۥ","لَمَجۡنُونٞ"],"t":"Those who disbelieve almost stab you with their glances when they hear the message, and say, “He is crazy!”","l":"Wa 'In Yakadu Al-Ladhina Kafaru Layuzliqunaka Bi'absarihim Lamma Sami`u Adh-Dhikra Wa Yaquluna 'Innahu Lamajnunun","w":[["wa-in","And indeed"],["yakādu","would almost"],["alladhīna","those who"],["kafarū","disbelieve"],["layuz'liqūnaka","surely make you slip"],["bi-abṣārihim","with their look"],["lammā","when"],["samiʿū","they hear"],["l-dhik'ra","the Message"],["wayaqūlūna","and they say"],["innahu","Indeed, he"],["lamajnūnun","(is) surely mad"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","هُوَ","إِلَّا","ذِكۡرٞ","لِّلۡعَٰلَمِينَ"],"t":"But it is no less than a reminder to all the Worlds","l":"Wa Ma Huwa 'Illa Dhikrun Lil`alamina","w":[["wamā","And not"],["huwa","it (is)"],["illā","but"],["dhik'run","a Reminder"],["lil'ʿālamīna","to the worlds"]]}]}